.TH SQ 1 1.4.0 "Sequoia PGP" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sq\-keyring\-split \- Split a keyring into individual keys
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.br
\fBsq keyring split\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIFILE\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Split a keyring into individual keys.
.PP
Splitting up a keyring into individual keys helps with curating a keyring.
.PP
The converse operation is `sq keyring merge`.
.PP


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Subcommand options"
.TP
\fB\-\-prefix\fR=\fIPREFIX\fR
Write to files with PREFIX [defaults: `FILE\-` if FILE is set, or `output\-` if read from stdin]
.TP
 \fIFILE\fR
Read from FILE or stdin if FILE is '\-'
.IP
[default: \fB\-\fR]
.SS "Global options"
See \fBsq\fR(1) for a description of the global options.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
Split all certificates.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq keyring split certs.pgp
.RE
.PP
.fi

.PP
Split all certificates, merging them first to avoid duplicates.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq keyring merge certs.pgp \\
.RE
.RS
.RS
| sq keyring split
.RE
.RE
.fi
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.nh
\fBsq\fR(1), \fBsq\-keyring\fR(1).
.hy
.PP
For the full documentation see <https://book.sequoia\-pgp.org>.
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
1.4.0
